sentences.text:
ORDER This is fifth application has been filed on behalf of the applicant for grant of temporary bail under Section 439 of Criminal Procedure Code, 1973, as he is arrested in relation to FIR/Crime No.508/2022 dated (not mentioned) registered at Police Station- Vijay Nagar, District-Indore (MP)
for offence punishable under Sections 370, 370(A), 363, 366, 376, 376(d), 377, 344, 323, 328,
506(II) of IPC, 1860 and 3/4, 16, 5(l)/6 of Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012 and Section 5(a), 5(b), 5(d) of Immoral Trafficking Act.

